#: includes/class-dfss-legacy.php:103
msgid "An older copy of DataFirefly Server-Side (folder \"datafirefly-serverside\") is still installed. It has been deactivated and this version has taken over with the same settings. You can delete the older copy from the Plugins screen: your settings are kept."
msgstr "Todavía hay instalada una copia anterior de DataFirefly Server-Side (carpeta \"datafirefly-serverside\"). Se ha desactivado y esta versión ha tomado el relevo con los mismos ajustes. Puede eliminar la copia anterior desde la pantalla de plugins: sus ajustes se conservan."

#: datafirefly-server-side.php
msgid "Expired"
msgstr "Caducado"

